WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.568 --> 00:00:03.670
HENRY:<i> Time travel.</i>

00:00:04.970 --> 00:00:06.172
<i> It's not a super power.</i>

00:00:06.706 --> 00:00:10.110
It's a disability.
It's what's wrong with me.

00:00:17.884 --> 00:00:18.785
<i> Can I help you?</i>

00:00:22.722 --> 00:00:23.656
Henry.

00:00:25.158 --> 00:00:26.726
Sorry, I don't know--

00:00:26.826 --> 00:00:28.227
Clare.

00:00:28.628 --> 00:00:30.563
So we've met, then.

00:00:30.663 --> 00:00:31.564
Yes.

00:00:37.337 --> 00:00:39.572
CLARE:<i> We just...
 happened to each other.</i>

00:00:40.773 --> 00:00:42.042
In the wrong order.

00:00:43.142 --> 00:00:44.210
HENRY: Any hobbies?

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:46.246
I'm your future wife.

00:00:52.451 --> 00:00:54.721
There are three things
that I got good at to survive.

00:00:57.656 --> 00:00:58.558
<i> Running.</i>

00:00:59.025 --> 00:01:00.092
<i> Fighting.</i>

00:01:00.192 --> 00:01:01.394
<i> And stealing.</i>

00:01:03.396 --> 00:01:05.298
The danger isn't the worst.

00:01:06.766 --> 00:01:08.168
Christmas is the worst.

00:01:10.536 --> 00:01:13.106
CLARE:<i> There are days
 he keeps going back to.</i>

00:01:13.339 --> 00:01:14.707
HENRY:<i> I can't control it.</i>

00:01:16.041 --> 00:01:17.577
<i> And I hate to be
 where she's not.</i>

00:01:21.180 --> 00:01:22.882
<i> I'm always going,
 and she can't follow.</i>

00:01:22.982 --> 00:01:24.617
This is me,
changing the future.

00:01:27.119 --> 00:01:28.821
HENRY:<i> I have tried
 to change it.</i>

00:01:28.921 --> 00:01:30.490
Trust me, you can't.

00:01:35.327 --> 00:01:36.763
YOUNG HENRY:
Mom!

00:01:40.066 --> 00:01:41.033
Hi everyone.

00:01:41.267 --> 00:01:42.902
-Who the hell are you?
-Who's he look like?

00:01:43.169 --> 00:01:44.537
<i> Ay, dios mio.</i>

00:01:44.737 --> 00:01:45.839
CLARE:<i> I love Henry more</i>

00:01:45.939 --> 00:01:47.673
than I could ever love
anyone else.

00:01:48.140 --> 00:01:49.476
So then, where is he?

00:01:51.778 --> 00:01:54.614
♪ (DRAMATIC MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:01:59.419 --> 00:02:00.653
HENRY:<i> I don't have very long.</i>

00:02:02.121 --> 00:02:03.590
<i> Nobody has very long.</i>

00:02:05.357 --> 00:02:06.526
<i> I think I'm going.</i>

00:02:07.093 --> 00:02:08.127
No, not now.

00:02:08.227 --> 00:02:09.362
I love you.

00:02:11.230 --> 00:02:15.201
CLARE:<i> Why is love
 intensified by absence?</i>

